      "description": "Site-wide primary action: Marker Pink, Ink outline, retro press shadow.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\">להוספה לסל</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{font-family:Rubik,system-ui,sans-serif;background:#ec4899;color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:1.25rem;padding:16px 40px;border:2px solid #545454;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 0 #545454;transition:all .1s;cursor:pointer}.ds-btn-primary:hover{background:#db2777;transform:translate(-1px,-1px);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 0 #545454}.ds-btn-primary:active{transform:translate(2px,2px);box-shadow:2px 2px 0 0 #545454}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #545454;outline-offset:3px}"
