      "refersTo": "card-product",
      "description": "Outlined paper card with a subject-wash media panel and a hard shadow.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-card\" href=\"#\" dir=\"rtl\"><div class=\"ds-card-media\"></div><h3 class=\"ds-card-title\">סודות ההצפנה</h3><p class=\"ds-card-text\">ספר שמלמד ילדים להצפין ולפענח.</p><div class=\"ds-card-foot\"><span class=\"ds-card-price\">₪89</span><span class=\"ds-card-more\">לפרטים</span></div></a>",
      "css": ".ds-card{display:block;width:280px;font-family:Rubik,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#545454;text-decoration:none;background:#fff;border:4px solid #545454;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 0 #545454;transition:all .2s}.ds-card:hover{background:#fdf2f8}.ds-card:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #545454;outline-offset:4px}.ds-card-media{background:#fce7f3;border-radius:12px;height:160px;margin-bottom:16px}.ds-card-title{font-weight:900;font-size:1.25rem;margin:0 0 8px}.ds-card-text{color:#4b5563;font-size:.875rem;margin:0 0 16px}.ds-card-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.ds-card-price{font-weight:900;font-size:1.5rem}.ds-card-more{color:#db2777;font-weight:700;font-size:.875rem}.ds-card:hover .ds-card-more{text-decoration:underline}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Riddles Pre-order Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "riddles-button-preorder",
      "description": "Riddles-scope action: Brick Red with the deeper press shadow and a Sun focus ring.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-r-press\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"/><path d=\"M2.05 2.05h2l2.66 12.42a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.58h9.78a2 2 0 0 0 1.95-1.57l1.65-7.43H5.12\"/></svg>להזמנה מוקדמת</button>",
      "css": ".ds-r-press{font-family:Rubik,system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:#b83c3a;color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:1.25rem;padding:20px 24px;border:3px solid #545454;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:5px 5px 0 0 #545454;transition:transform 120ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),box-shadow 120ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),background-color 150ms;cursor:pointer}.ds-r-press:hover{background:#9c2f2d;transform:translate(-2px,-2px);box-shadow:7px 7px 0 0 #545454}.ds-r-press:active{transform:translate(4px,4px);box-shadow:1px 1px 0 0 #545454}.ds-r-press:focus-visible{outline:4px solid #facc15;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Riddles Price Ticket",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "riddles-price-ticket",
      "description": "Pre-order price as a ticket: price on the main part, arrival month on a perforated Sun stub.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-r-ticket\" dir=\"rtl\"><div class=\"ds-r-ticket-main\"><p class=\"ds-r-ticket-label\">מחיר רכישה מוקדמת</p><p class=\"ds-r-ticket-row\"><span class=\"ds-r-ticket-price\"><span style=\"font-size:.5em\">₪</span>102</span><s class=\"ds-r-ticket-list\">₪120</s><span class=\"ds-r-ticket-save\">חוסכים ₪18</span></p></div><div class=\"ds-r-ticket-stub\"><span class=\"ds-r-stub-small\">מגיע במהלך</span><span class=\"ds-r-stub-month\">נובמבר</span><span class=\"ds-r-stub-year\">2026</span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-r-ticket{font-family:Rubik,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#545454;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;overflow:hidden;max-width:460px;background:#fff;border:4px solid #545454;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 0 #545454}.ds-r-ticket-main{padding:16px 24px}.ds-r-ticket-label{margin:0;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:700;color:#31508f}.ds-r-ticket-row{margin:4px 0 0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:8px 12px}.ds-r-ticket-price{font-size:56px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-r-ticket-list{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#767676;text-decoration-color:#b83c3a;text-decoration-thickness:3px}.ds-r-ticket-save{background:#b83c3a;color:#fff;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:900;padding:4px 8px;border:2px solid #545454;border-radius:6px}.ds-r-ticket-stub{display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;padding:0 20px;background:#facc15;border-inline-start:4px dashed #545454}.ds-r-stub-small{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700}.ds-r-stub-month{font-family:Karantina,Rubik,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:46px;line-height:.9}.ds-r-stub-year{font-size:.875rem;font-weight:900}"
